{"vid":"FtCs-V4oWpY","source":"FtCs-V4oWpY.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":2.9,"txt":"So, an electrician opens the door,"},{"t":5.3,"txt":"reaches in to reset the breaker, and in"},{"t":7.7,"txt":"less time than it takes to blink, his"},{"t":9.8,"txt":"world explodes in a blinding flash of"},{"t":11.8,"txt":"light hotter than the surface of the"},{"t":13.3,"txt":"sun. That's an arc flash. Here's what"},{"t":17.1,"txt":"most people don't understand. Ark flash"},{"t":20.1,"txt":"isn't regular electrical shock. When an"},{"t":22.8,"txt":"arc fault occurs, electrical current"},{"t":25.3,"txt":"jumps through the air, creating plasma"},{"t":27.1,"txt":"that reaches 35,000° F. That's four"},{"t":31,"txt":"times hotter than the surface of the"},{"t":32.5,"txt":"sun. The explosion happens so fast that"},{"t":35.4,"txt":"copper bus bars vaporize instantly,"},{"t":37.9,"txt":"sending molten metal flying. The"},{"t":40.2,"txt":"pressure wave alone can rupture eardrums"},{"t":42.4,"txt":"and throw workers across the room. Why"},{"t":45,"txt":"does this happen? You've got bare bus"},{"t":47.5,"txt":"bars carrying hundreds or thousands of"},{"t":49.1,"txt":"amps just inches from grounded metal"},{"t":51.1,"txt":"surfaces inside a confined enclosure."},{"t":54.1,"txt":"When something goes wrong, maybe a tool"},{"t":56.1,"txt":"drops between phases or insulation fails"},{"t":59.1,"txt":"or there's contamination on the bus"},{"t":60.9,"txt":"bars. That electrical energy comes out"},{"t":63.2,"txt":"violently. One of the common trigger is"},{"t":66,"txt":"human error during racking operations."},{"t":68.4,"txt":"That's when you're inserting or removing"},{"t":69.9,"txt":"a circuit breaker from the cabinet. If"},{"t":72.5,"txt":"the breaker isn't aligned correctly or"},{"t":74.2,"txt":"if you're racking under load when you"},{"t":75.9,"txt":"shouldn't be, you can create the perfect"},{"t":78.1,"txt":"conditions for arc flash. Another major"},{"t":81,"txt":"cause is working on energized equipment"},{"t":83,"txt":"without proper procedures."},{"t":85.4,"txt":"Someone opens a panel to troubleshoot,"},{"t":87.6,"txt":"not wearing arc rated PPE because"},{"t":89.8,"txt":"they're just going to look. Then they"},{"t":91.8,"txt":"accidentally bridge two phases with a"},{"t":93.4,"txt":"screwdriver or test probe. The ark flash"},{"t":96.2,"txt":"happens before they can pull their hand"},{"t":97.8,"txt":"back. The intense heat causes severe"},{"t":100.3,"txt":"burns through clothing that isn't"},{"t":101.7,"txt":"arcrated. Regular work clothes ignite"},{"t":104.1,"txt":"instantly. The ultraviolet light causes"},{"t":106.6,"txt":"permanent eye damage. The pressure wave"},{"t":108.9,"txt":"causes internal injuries, ruptured"},{"t":111,"txt":"eardrums, and concussions. Workers have"},{"t":113.8,"txt":"been thrown 10 ft backward from the"},{"t":115.4,"txt":"pressure wave alone. So, how do we"},{"t":117.8,"txt":"prevent this? First rule, deenergize"},{"t":121.3,"txt":"whenever possible. Energized work should"},{"t":123.8,"txt":"only happen when there's absolutely no"},{"t":125.8,"txt":"way to deenergize."},{"t":127.9,"txt":"Convenience doesn't count as a valid"},{"t":129.7,"txt":"reason. When you must work energized,"},{"t":132,"txt":"you need an energized electrical work"},{"t":133.8,"txt":"permit. This forces you to calculate the"},{"t":136.6,"txt":"incident energy level, determine the ARK"},{"t":139.1,"txt":"flash boundary, and specify the exact"},{"t":141.6,"txt":"PPE required. No permit means proper"},{"t":144.6,"txt":"safety procedures aren't being followed."},{"t":147.1,"txt":"ARK-rated PPE must match the incident"},{"t":149.6,"txt":"energy level. It can range from 4"},{"t":151.8,"txt":"calories per square cime up to 40 or"},{"t":154.2,"txt":"more. An 8C cal suit won't protect you"},{"t":157.1,"txt":"on 25 cal equipment. You'll get burned"},{"t":159.8,"txt":"right through it. Know your boundaries."},{"t":162.8,"txt":"The ark flash boundary is the distance"},{"t":164.6,"txt":"where you could receive a secondderee"},{"t":166.2,"txt":"burn. For high energy that can be 10 ft"},{"t":169.2,"txt":"or more, everyone inside that boundary"},{"t":171.4,"txt":"needs full arcrated PPE. Critical point"},{"t":174.9,"txt":"about racking. Never rack a breaker"},{"t":177.6,"txt":"under load unless the equipment is"},{"t":179.8,"txt":"specifically designed for that and"},{"t":181.4,"txt":"you've been trained. Most systems"},{"t":183.6,"txt":"requires you to open the upstream"},{"t":185.4,"txt":"disconnect, verify it's deenergized,"},{"t":188.2,"txt":"then rack the breaker. Racking while"},{"t":191,"txt":"energized is a leading cause of arc"},{"t":193,"txt":"flash incidents. Before opening any"},{"t":195.7,"txt":"door, verify it's deenergized."},{"t":198.8,"txt":"Test your tester. Test the equipment."},{"t":201.3,"txt":"Test your tester again. A faulty voltage"},{"t":204.1,"txt":"tester showing zero volts. When there's"},{"t":207,"txt":"actually 480 present is how electricians"},{"t":209.4,"txt":"get fatal incidents. If you witness an"},{"t":211.9,"txt":"ark flash, don't rush in without PPE."},{"t":214.7,"txt":"Call emergency help immediately. If the"},{"t":217.5,"txt":"victim is still in contact with"},{"t":219.1,"txt":"equipment, power must be shut off first."},{"t":222,"txt":"Ark flash victims need immediate medical"},{"t":224.3,"txt":"attention, but rescuers must protect"},{"t":226.7,"txt":"themselves first. The bottom line, ark"},{"t":229.9,"txt":"flash is catastrophic. Severe burns,"},{"t":232.9,"txt":"blindness, permanent disfigurement, and"},{"t":235,"txt":"death. Before you open that door, ask"},{"t":237.8,"txt":"yourself, can this be deenergized?"},{"t":240.7,"txt":"Do I have a work permit? Am I wearing"},{"t":243.2,"txt":"correct PPE? Have I verified it's"},{"t":246.2,"txt":"deenergized?"},{"t":247.8,"txt":"Do I know the ark flash boundary? Am I"},{"t":250.4,"txt":"trained for this? If the answer to any"},{"t":253,"txt":"question is no, stop. Don't proceed. It"},{"t":256.7,"txt":"doesn't matter how experienced you are."},{"t":259.2,"txt":"One mistake, one shortcut, one"},{"t":261.3,"txt":"assumption, and 35,000° of plasma is"},{"t":264.3,"txt":"coming at you faster than you can react."},{"t":267.2,"txt":"Please stay safe on the job."},{"t":269.7,"txt":"Did you know that in 2020, a study"},{"t":272.2,"txt":"conducted by the Associated Builders and"},{"t":274.6,"txt":"Contractors found [music] that daily"},{"t":276.6,"txt":"safety toolbox talks lead to a"},{"t":279,"txt":"remarkable 82% reduction in total"},{"t":282.3,"txt":"recordable incident rates compared to"},{"t":284.5,"txt":"those conducted monthly. The study shows"},{"t":286.8,"txt":"that the frequency of toolbox talks"},{"t":289.1,"txt":"directly correlates with incident rates."},{"t":291.7,"txt":"Consistent safety toolbox talks lead to"},{"t":294.6,"txt":"less accidents, which is why many"},{"t":296.6,"txt":"companies this year are using Safely EO"},{"t":299.5,"txt":"to create and schedule these talks weeks"},{"t":302.5,"txt":"and months in advance. So your team will"},{"t":305.2,"txt":"be consistently reminded of the job"},{"t":307.4,"txt":"hazards and safety protocols. [music]"},{"t":309.4,"txt":"You get access to Safely Yo's toolbox"},{"t":312,"txt":"talk library that comes with hundreds of"},{"t":314.6,"txt":"textbased and video-based toolbox talks"},{"t":317.4,"txt":"that [music] covers any industry. The"},{"t":319.3,"txt":"Toolbox Talk app makes it easy for your"},{"t":322.1,"txt":"employees and supervisors to consume"},{"t":325,"txt":"safety talks from their own mobile"},{"t":326.8,"txt":"devices [music] and acknowledge its"},{"t":329,"txt":"completion at the click of a button. All"},{"t":331.2,"txt":"completed safety talks are tracked and"},{"t":333.4,"txt":"[music] the data can be exported and"},{"t":335.1,"txt":"available for use. The platform"},{"t":337,"txt":"digitizes your safety talks process so"},{"t":339.8,"txt":"you can focus on what really matters,"},{"t":342,"txt":"keeping your team safe and informed."},{"t":344.3,"txt":"Don't wait until it's too late."},{"t":346,"txt":"Workplace incidents can cost your"},{"t":348,"txt":"company millions in liability, [music]"},{"t":350,"txt":"lost productivity, and damage"},{"t":351.9,"txt":"reputation. To learn more, just click"},{"t":354.4,"txt":"[music] the link in the description of"},{"t":355.8,"txt":"this video to request a quick demo."}],"words":[{"t":2.879,"w":"So,"},{"t":3.2,"w":"an"},{"t":3.439,"w":"electrician"},{"t":4,"w":"opens"},{"t":4.319,"w":"the"},{"t":4.56,"w":"door,"},{"t":5.279,"w":"reaches"},{"t":5.6,"w":"in"},{"t":5.839,"w":"to"},{"t":6,"w":"reset"},{"t":6.319,"w":"the"},{"t":6.48,"w":"breaker,"},{"t":7.279,"w":"and"},{"t":7.44,"w":"in"},{"t":7.68,"w":"less"},{"t":7.919,"w":"time"},{"t":8.08,"w":"than"},{"t":8.24,"w":"it"},{"t":8.4,"w":"takes"},{"t":8.639,"w":"to"},{"t":8.8,"w":"blink,"},{"t":9.519,"w":"his"},{"t":9.76,"w":"world"},{"t":10.08,"w":"explodes"},{"t":10.48,"w":"in"},{"t":10.719,"w":"a"},{"t":10.8,"w":"blinding"},{"t":11.28,"w":"flash"},{"t":11.519,"w":"of"},{"t":11.759,"w":"light"},{"t":12,"w":"hotter"},{"t":12.32,"w":"than"},{"t":12.48,"w":"the"},{"t":12.639,"w":"surface"},{"t":12.96,"w":"of"},{"t":13.12,"w":"the"},{"t":13.28,"w":"sun."},{"t":14.48,"w":"That's"},{"t":14.719,"w":"an"},{"t":14.88,"w":"arc"},{"t":15.28,"w":"flash."},{"t":16.56,"w":"Here's"},{"t":16.88,"w":"what"},{"t":17.119,"w":"most"},{"t":17.44,"w":"people"},{"t":17.76,"w":"don't"},{"t":18,"w":"understand."},{"t":19.279,"w":"Ark"},{"t":19.68,"w":"flash"},{"t":20.08,"w":"isn't"},{"t":20.4,"w":"regular"},{"t":20.88,"w":"electrical"},{"t":21.359,"w":"shock."},{"t":22.4,"w":"When"},{"t":22.64,"w":"an"},{"t":22.8,"w":"arc"},{"t":23.119,"w":"fault"},{"t":23.519,"w":"occurs,"},{"t":24.4,"w":"electrical"},{"t":24.88,"w":"current"},{"t":25.279,"w":"jumps"},{"t":25.6,"w":"through"},{"t":25.76,"w":"the"},{"t":25.92,"w":"air,"},{"t":26.